gh $4.0B of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -0.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 0.1% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 0/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Carries a 57% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.5690948808053946},{"text":"Accruals running hot at +6.4% of assets \u2014 earnings quality bears watching","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 8.4% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $8.8M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Daniel B. Gilbert 2025 GRAT Reports Initial Ownership of 450 Million Shares in Rocket Companies","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/daniel-b-gilbert-2025-grat-reports-initial-ownership-of-450-million-shares-in-rocke